---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import club from '../lib/club';

// The club's two domains, as its selection mails describe them
const domains = [
  { name: 'GameDev', what: 'Making games from scratch: programming the gameplay, and designing characters, 3D models, animation, 2D assets and UI.' },
  { name: 'E-Sports', what: 'Planning and running our tournaments, promotion and event banners, and playtesting and bug-hunting the games GameDev makes.' },
];
---
<Base title="Join" current="join" description="How to join Glitch, IIT Hyderabad's video game club: the Discord, our two domains and who leads it.">
  <div class="wrap page">
  <h1><span class="glitch" data-text="Join Glitch" data-glitch-load>Join Glitch</span></h1>
  <p class="lead">
    The easiest way in is our Discord server, the Glitch Basement. Club news also goes out by mail to every student.
  </p>
  <p><a class="btn" href={club.discord}>Join the Discord <Icon name="external" /></a></p>

  <section>
    <h2>How Joining Works</h2>
    <p>Most of our events, jams and workshops are open to everyone at IITH; you don't need to be a member to take part.</p>
    <p>
      To join the team, watch for a recruitment round; we announce them by mail and on Discord. The club has two domains:
    </p>
    <dl class="domains">
      {domains.map((d) => (<><dt>{d.name}</dt><dd>{d.what}</dd></>))}
    </dl>
    <p>Rounds so far have asked for a playable game or a set of game assets for GameDev, and a tournament plan for E-Sports. Past rounds are listed under <a href="/events/">Events</a>.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Leads</h2>
    <ul class="leads">
      {club.leads.map((l) => (
        <li><strong>{l.name}</strong><br /><span class="soft">{l.role}</span></li>
      ))}
    </ul>
  </section>

  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  section { margin-top: var(--u8); }
  .leads li { padding: var(--u2); background: var(--panel); }
  .domains {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: max-content minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: var(--u1) var(--u4);
    margin: 0 0 var(--u2);
  }
  dt { font-weight: 700; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--u1); }
  dd { margin: 0; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .domains dt { font: 700 1.375rem/1.2 var(--font-heading); color: var(--amber); }
  @media (max-width: 559px) {
    .domains { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 0; }
    .domains dd { margin-bottom: var(--u2); }
  }
  .leads {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--u4);
  }
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .leads { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
  }
</style>
